  'between sp' is the sd of TRUE per-pitcher means, sampling
  noise removed. It is a LOWER bound on real between-start
  variation (opponent, park and rest vary inside a pitcher's
  own season too). Compare 'within sp' to 'our within': if
  ours is the larger, the simulator is over-dispersed per
  start and every 'implied true' in ceiling.py is understated.
